  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>There is a <chord name="Bdim"/>quiet place,<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Far from the <chord name="E/G#"/>rapid <chord name="C"/>pace where God <chord name="F"/>can soothe <chord name="Em"/>my <chord name="Am"/>troubled <chord name="Dm"/>mind.<br/>
      <chord name="Dm"/>Sheltered <chord name="G"/>by <chord name="Dm"/>tree <chord name="F/C"/>and <chord name="C"/>flow&#x27;r,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>There in my <chord name="C"/>quiet <chord name="Dm"/>hour with Him <chord name="Gm/A#"/>my cares <chord name="C/G"/>are left <chord name="B7"/>behind.<br/>
      <chord name="Em"/>Whether <chord name="Dm"/>a <chord name="C"/>garden small,<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Or <chord name="Em/B"/>on a mountain <chord name="Am"/>tall, <chord name="E/G#"/>New <chord name="C"/>strength and courage <chord name="F"/>there <chord name="Am/E"/>I <chord name="Em"/>find;<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>Then from <chord name="C/G"/>this <chord name="Am"/>quiet place<br/>
      <chord name="Am"/>I <chord name="F"/>go prepared <chord name="Em"/>to face <chord name="Dm/A"/>a new <chord name="A7"/>day <chord name="Am"/>With <chord name="Dm"/>love <chord name="G#"/>for <chord name="G7"/>all mankind.
      </lines>
    </verse>
